  "name": "New Webinar Attendance -Tags and Q&A update [BigMarker]",
  "description": "Enroll: New records created when a webinar attendance record with \"Attended Webinar?\" set to \"Yes\" and a campaign tag is present.\nAction: Append the Webinar Attendance 'Campaign tag' value to the associated contact record's 'Webinar attended' property. ",
  "uuid": "New Webinar Attendance -Tags and Q&A update-1698324629",
  "createdAt": "2025-09-25T09:07:51.036Z",
